y.","t":{"ru":"таможня, таможенная служба","nl":"douane","pl":"urząd celny, cło, służba celna","de":"Zoll, Zollbehörde","fr":"douane, service des douanes","it":"dogana, autorità doganale","cs":"celní správa, celnice","tr":"gümrük, gümrük idaresi","es":"aduana, servicio de aduanas"}},{"w":"delay","d":"A period of time when something is late, or the situation of waiting for something to happen.","t":{"ru":"задержка, опоздание, промедление","nl":"vertraging, oponthoud","pl":"opóźnienie, zwłoka","de":"Verzögerung, Verspätung","fr":"retard, délai","it":"ritardo, dilazione","cs":"zpoždění, proleva, zdržení","tr":"gecikme, rötar, tehir","es":"retraso, demora, atraso"}},{"w":"delayed","d":"Happening later than is usual, expected, or desired.","t":{"ru":"задержанный, запоздалый, отложенный","nl":"vertraagd, laat, uitgesteld","pl":"opóźniony, odłożony, spóźniony","de":"verspätet, verzögert, aufgeschoben","fr":"retardé, tardif, différé","it":"in ritardo, ritardato, posticipato","cs":"zpožděný, opožděný, odložený","tr":"gecikmeli, gecikmiş, ertelenmiş","es":"retrasado, demorado, tardío"}},{"w":"depart","d":"To go away or leave a place, especially to start a journey.","t":{"ru":"отправляться, уезжать, отходить","nl":"vertrekken, verlaten","pl":"odjeżdżać, odchodzić, wyjeżdżać","de":"abfahren, abreisen, aufbrechen","fr":"partir, quitter","it":"partire, andare via, allontanarsi","cs":"odjet, odcestovat, odejít","tr":"hareket etmek, ayrılmak, yola çıkmak","es":"partir, salir, irse"}},{"w":"departure","d":"The act of leaving a place, especially to start a journey.","t":{"ru":"отправление, отъезд, вылет","nl":"vertrek","pl":"odjazd, odlot, wyjazd","de":"Abfahrt, Abreise, Abflug","fr":"départ","it":"partenza","cs":"odjezd, odlet, odchod","tr":"kalkış, hareket, ayrılış","es":"salida, partida"}},{"w":"destination","d":"The place set for the end of a journey, or to which something is sent; the point aimed at.","t":{"ru":"пункт назначения, место назначения, направление","nl":"bestemming, 